      "p_a_canonical": 0.9686412924897334,
      "prose": {
        "text": "Fully remote.\n\nOne reason is that the data suggests that fully remote teams can achieve similar or even higher productivity levels compared to in-office teams, especially when considering the long-term impact of remote work on employee output.",
        "tokens": 43,
